# Cancel Subscription Skill

This skill allows a customer to cancel their subscription by accepting a subscription ID, setting the cancellation effective date to the end of the current billing period, and calculating/reporting a prorated refund if canceled mid-cycle.

## Conversation Template

User: I want to cancel my subscription.
Skill: Please provide your subscription ID.
User: [provides subscription ID]
Skill: Your subscription will be cancelled effective at the end of your current billing period. If you cancel mid-cycle, a prorated refund will be calculated and applied.
Skill: Processing cancellation...
Skill: Your subscription with ID {subscription_id} has been successfully cancelled.
Skill: Your cancellation will take effect on {cancellation_date}.
Skill: {refund_message}

## Refund Calculation

- If cancellation date is mid-cycle, calculate prorated refund based on unused days.
- Otherwise, no refund applies.

## Variables

- subscription_id: the ID provided by the user
- cancellation_date: end of current billing period
- refund_message: details of any prorated refund or no refund message

